        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, Cathal Coughlan\n- Organizations: Hinder, The Fatima Mansions, Microdisney\n- Places: Oklahoma, Cork\n- Products: \"Get Stoned\"\n\nFacts:\n- The Fatima Mansions were an art rock group formed in 1988 by Cathal Coughlan, a singer and keyboardist from Cork.\n- Cathal Coughlan had previously been a member of Microdisney before forming The Fatima Mansions.\n- Hinder is an American rock band from Oklahoma that was formed in 2001.\n- Hinder was formed by lead singer Austin Winkler, lead guitarist Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and drummer Cody Hanson.\n- \"Get Stoned\" is a song by the American rock band Hinder.",
